The solution has a subtle enumeration error: for \(a=0\), the value \(n=25\) itself (i.e., \(m=1\), \(p=5\)) satisfies \(r_2(25)=4\cdot(2+1)=12\), but it was omitted from the list. The pair \((\pm3,\pm4)\), \((\pm4,\pm3)\), \((\pm5,0)\), \((0,\pm5)\) gives exactly 12 points. All other values listed are correct, and the formula and casework are otherwise fine.

So the sum should be \(2221 + 25 = 2246\).

